摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Reference and control existing Chrome and Edge tabs from DeepSeek Harness (DSH plugin + companion extension)","id":"gh:1417162408","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-doyourweb","slug":"SheepofSheep/dsh-doyourweb","topics":["cdp","chrome-extension","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","edge-extension","playwright"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Reference and control existing Chrome and Edge tabs from DeepSeek Harness (DSH plugin + companion ex"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"e and control existing Chrome and Edge tabs from DeepSeek Harness (DSH plugin + companion extension)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-doyourweb"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Reference and control your existing, logged-in Chrome and Edge tabs from DeepSeek Harness, with comp"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"act page context and batched browser actions."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Version `0.2.2` refreshes open `@` / `/` browser candidates and the webpage sidebar when the compani"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"on extension connects, disconnects or changes tabs, without requiring a different search query. It a"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"lso fixes empty application lists on Windows when a protected process has unreadable identity metada"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ta. The sidebar and `@` menu continue listing other running application windows. Browser actions ret"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"ain execution evidence after failures, can narrow their post-action snapshot with `observation`, and"},{"id":"p4s6","text":" optionally check one final `expect` condition. See browser workflow and diagnostics, optimization d"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"ecisions and app control."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Local Demo · Quick Start · Usage"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"*Current browser panel rendered with the installed DSH React and UI primitives, using sample tabs. T"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"his is a component preview, not a full DSH host screenshot.*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 01 · Introduction"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Browser tasks often depend on pages you have already opened and accounts you have already signed int"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"o. dsh-doyourweb connects those tabs to DeepSeek Harness instead of launching a separate automation "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"browser or exporting cookies."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The project has two parts: a DSH plugin and a companion Manifest V3 extension. The plugin adds brows"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"er references to the native `@` and `/` menus; the extension supplies tab metadata and browser contr"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ol. Once paired, the extension reconnects in the background without keeping its popup open."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Current version: **0.2.2** for both the package and browser extension. See the changelog."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 02 · Preview"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Use `/browser` to open the connection page and locate the extension folder.\n2. Load the extension"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" in Chrome or Edge, then approve its matching four-digit pairing code.\n3. Open **Browser** from the "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"left navigation, or use `@`, to add an existing page to the current chat draft. Send the draft when "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"avigation, or use `@`, to add an existing page to the current chat draft. Send the draft when ready."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The real annotation toolbar rendered on a local test page. Collapse keeps the toolbar visible; dock "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"leaves a small edge button and preserves the draft and position."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The real local connection page rendered with a sample pairing request. These previews are not an aut"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nection page rendered with a sample pairing request. These previews are not an automation recording."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Local Demo"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"There is no public hosted demo. After the DSH plugin starts, its default local connection page is ht"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tp://127.0.0.1:43187/setup. Browser control runs through this local bridge and the installed extensi"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"//127.0.0.1:43187/setup. Browser control runs through this local bridge and the installed extension."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 03 · Core Features"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Feature | Current behavior |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Existing tabs | Reuses regular HTTP/HTTPS and authorized local file:// tabs and their login state "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"in Chrome and Edge. |\n| Native references | Lists page titles, sites and icons through DSH's `@` and"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" `/` menus. |\n| Browser sidebar | Native left navigation opens a session-owned right panel for pages"},{"id":"p20s4","text":", running apps and local diagnostics. Picks append references to the current draft without sending. "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"|\n| Compact context | Page/app context, annotations and manually referenced logs appear as expandabl"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"e chips; their serialized model context is preserved. |\n| Compact reading | Accessibility snapshots "},{"id":"p20s7","text":"support selector/query narrowing and cursor pagination. Initial reference context shares a default 2"},{"id":"p20s8","text":",400-character budget. |\n| Batched actions | Runs up to 12 typed actions per call, including uploads"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"; stops on failure/document navigation. Query/hash routes only continue observations or target-free "},{"id":"p20s10","text":"steps. |\n| Result extraction | Returns selected `text`, `value` and `href` fields, with up to 20 row"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"s per extraction. |\n| Scoped receipts | `summary` skips the next snapshot; `handle` returns a fresh "},{"id":"p20s12","text":"ID/cursor without text. `observation` explicitly narrows the post-action snapshot. Read the handle c"},{"id":"p20s13","text":"ursor before using element refs. |\n| Final checks | Optional `expect` checks visibility, contained t"},{"id":"p20s14","text":"ext, an exact input value or exact URL once after the batch. The result stays separate from complete"},{"id":"p20s15","text":"d actions and does not replay effects. |\n| File uploads | Hidden inputs, custom choosers and iframe "},{"id":"p20s16","text":"selectors; requires a selected tab and exact user-supplied absolute file paths. |\n| Drag and drop | "},{"id":"p20s17","text":"Drag between elements in the same frame, or drop authorized local files and MIME data onto an elemen"},{"id":"p20s18","text":"t. |\n| Network metadata | Explicit start/stop capture, 200-entry capacity, filtered pages of 10 (up "},{"id":"p20s19","text":"to 20). No query strings, credentials, headers or bodies. |\n| Local diagnostics | Bounded in-memory "},{"id":"p20s20","text":"command stages, duration and error codes; disable, clear, export or explicitly add logs to the draft"},{"id":"p20s21","text":"es, duration and error codes; disable, clear, export or explicitly add logs to the draft. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### WebMCP-First Control (Experimental)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 04 · Architecture"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Layer | Technology |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| DSH host plugin | Node.js 22+, JavaScript ESM, Cordis integration |\n| Native client UI | React and"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" DSH UI primitives |\n| Browser engine | Playwright Core 1.64.0, Chrome DevTools Protocol |\n| Site to"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ols | `document.modelContext`, Ajv 8.20.0 argument validation |\n| Local bridge | WebSocket (`ws`), Z"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"od validation |\n| Browser extension | Manifest V3, `chrome.tabs`, `chrome.debugger` |\n| App connecto"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"rs | Official MCP SDK 1.32.1, stdio / Streamable HTTP, literal CLI argument arrays |\n| Build and che"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"cks | esbuild, Node.js test runner, GitHub Actions |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Only tabs referenced by the user in the current conversation are available to the model's browser to"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ols. Page content is treated as untrusted data, not instructions or permission."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Node.js 22+ and npm.\n- DeepSeek Harness; plugin API compatibility has been checked against `0.2.0-"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"rc.2`.\n- Chromium-based Chrome or Edge 125+, with developer mode available for loading an unpacked e"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"Chromium-based Chrome or Edge 125+, with developer mode available for loading an unpacked extension."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
